<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabo Securities cuts Endemol to sell.</title>
<headline>Rabo Securities cuts Endemol to sell.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dec 20 research.</p>
<p>Company---Sector-------------Price---Broker------------</p>
<p>ENDEMOL   Publishing/media   57.00   Rabo Securities</p>
<p>Comment: Downgraded to SELL from HOLD. Risks outweigh growth opportunities. Investors more aware of risks after collapse of Sport 7. Comparison with PolyGram, VNU, Elsevier, Ahold suggest shares overvalued by 25 pct. Price of NLG 42-45 appropriate.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E	Dividend</p>
<p>    95/96 (actual)     2.06     ---	27.5     0.00</p>
<p>    96/97		  2.20     2.25     25.7     0.70</p>
<p>    97/98		  2.40     2.50     23.6     0.80</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
